==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~20 seconds<sup>100f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Upgrade your [[Worker Cat]] to max level. When the enemies are nearing your base, send out a few [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]] to stall. By the time Kang Roo appears, your wallet should be maxed out, which is when you can send out all of your [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] at the same time. Once you kill Kang Roo, the rest of the stage should be a piece of cake. Finish things off with [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cats]] and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cats]]. If you take too long, another Kang Roo might appear, but she won't be that much of a threat.

Colombia can be also be cheesed in pretty much the exact way as [[Jamaica (Empire of Cats)|Jamaica]]. Spam DPS units (such as Bird Cat and [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]]) to destroy the enemy base before Kang Roo and the supports come out.

