==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Gunma Prefecture'''.
*The text on Gunma Prefecture's base is "くさつ", which reads as "[[wikipedia:Kusatsu, Gunma|Kusatsu]]" - a town in Gunma that is extremely popular among tourists for its hot spring resort, [[wikipedia:Kusatsu Onsen|Kusatsu Onsen]].

